# BIOL 114 Practice Quiz App

## Author

Dr. Michelle Gilbert  
Assistant Teaching Professor  
University Park, Pennsylvania

Website: https://michellemorphometrics.com

##Description

An interactive quiz application designed to support student learning in introductory biology through retrieval practice, self-assessment, and immediate feedback.

## Purpose

This tool was developed by Dr. Michelle Gilbert to help students:

- Review biological concepts by topic and exam.
- Receive immediate feedback on responses.
- Identify areas requiring additional study.
- Practice in a low-stakes learning environment.

## Features

- Exam-specific and topic-specific review.
- Accessibility options, including dyslexia-friendly font support.
- Reduced-motion mode.
- Progress tracking.
- Immediate answer feedback.

## Teaching Philosophy

This application reflects a teaching philosophy centered on active learning, metacognition, and evidence-based study strategies. Learning is strengthened when students regularly retrieve information, reflect on mistakes, and engage with course material in meaningful ways.

